WEBVTT

00:09.920 --> 00:14.800
However thanks to the success of the reforms the imperial treasury was full.

00:15.160 --> 00:20.320
For a time the economy and culture south of Tianhe all achieved unprecedented development.

00:20.840 --> 00:23.920
The people of the south were prosperous and content.

00:24.920 --> 00:28.960
The 31st year of Longwu Sikong Yao died of illness in the capital.

00:29.040 --> 00:33.360
Later generations often debated his merits and faults according to historical records.

00:33.500 --> 00:38.000
Emperor Xuankang.

